Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ウィクロス Selector Infected WIXOSS 由 minyain 手抄自 Airota 千夏字募組
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.73,0:00:02.19,PS2,,0,0,0,,{\an8}明天開始有強勁的北風
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.46,0:00:05.52,PS2,,0,0,0,,{\an8}部分靠近太平洋地區會有降雨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,看來要把洗好的衣服拿到屋子裡來晾了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.76,0:00:08.48,PS2,,0,0,0,,{\an8}氣溫與去年相比來的較低
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.51,0:00:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,奶奶我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.33,0:00:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎回來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.68,0:00:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我用一下哥哥的電腦喔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.93,0:00:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.09,0:00:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 快點快點
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.46,0:00:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,人家不擅長用電腦嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.83,0:00:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,呃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.73,0:00:24.83,PS2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(612,455)\fs50}小湊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:24.83,PS2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1042,463)\fs50}露子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.21,0:00:33.10,PS2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(936,801)\fs50}日期
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.05,0:00:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,難道說
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.20,0:00:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,她想聚集所有選擇者 然後一起對戰？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.20,0:00:39.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,{\pos(920,1000)}<Selector>
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.64,0:00:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,離我家非常近
